# Pinout

## Arduino Nano
- A4 -> SDA (INA226 + LCD I2C)
- A5 -> SCL (INA226 + LCD I2C)
- D3 -> Push button ke GND (INPUT_PULLUP)
- 5V -> VCC INA226, VCC LCD
- GND -> GND INA226, GND LCD, GND button

## I2C Address
- INA226: `0x44` (default umum modul)
- LCD 16x2 I2C: `0x27` (cek scanner bila beda)
